# Balin, Loremaster's "If you have an enduring story, Balin deals X damage to each opponent" is asked as the ability resolves
# (CR 608.2c), not as it triggers. Balin enters on turn nine beside only Mox Ruby, two, so its ability triggers without the
# story; in response Bot1 flashes in Sewer-veillance Cam, an artifact and the third, and has the story when the ability
# resolves (the Cam's own enters ability, above it, taps or untaps Balin and changes nothing here): Bot1 discards three
# Plains, draws three, and Balin deals 3 damage to Bot2.

